flowchart TD
    EVT[Build events reuse build fail] --> DB[(History DB)]
    LOGS[Log entries] --> DB
    CHUNKS[Log chunks] --> DB
    DB --> SUMMARY[Status counts failures slowest]
    DB --> VARIANTS[Variant history per package]
    DB --> RECENT[Recent events]
    DB --> MANIFEST[Manifest writer]
    MANIFEST --> FILE[/manifest.json/]
    DB --> LOGREPLAY[Log chunk replay]
    LOGREPLAY --> API
    SUMMARY --> API
    RECENT --> API
    FILE --> API
    DB --> API
    API --> HUB[Log hub]
    HUB --> UI[UI live tail]
